News - How to properly maintain wooden toys?
With the improvement of living standards and the development of early childhood education toys, the maintenance of toys has become a matter of concern to everyone, especially for wooden toys. However, many parents do not know how to maintain the toy, which causes damage or shortens the service life of the toy.
It is necessary to keep the wooden children’s toys dry at ordinary times and place the toys in a dry environment.
The storage place should avoid moisture. Wood materials will swell due to humidity in humid places, the material will become soft, and even delamination may occur.
