Do you know what are the main performance requirements of the target material ?
In order to enable you to better understand the target material , today Luoyang Si Feng’s editor will introduce the main performance requirements of the target material .
Purity is one of the main performance indicators of the target , because the purity of the target has a great impact on the performance of the film .
However , in practical applications , the purity requirements of the target materials are different .
The density of the target not only affects the sputtering rate , the density of sputtering particles and discharge phenomena , but also affects the electrical and optical properties of the film .
In addition , improve the density and strength of the target material so that the target material can better withstand the thermal stress in the sputtering process , so the density is also one of the key performance indicators of the target material .
Target material as the cathode source in sputtering , impurities in the material and oxygen and water in the pores is the main source of pollution in the deposited film .
The requirements of different impurity contents are different for different target materials of different applications .
According to a foreign company , if the grain size of the titanium target is controlled below 100um , and the change in grain size is kept within 20%, the quality of the sputtered film can be substantially improved .
The crystallization direction of the material affects the thickness uniformity of the sputtering film , so the crystallization direction is also the main performance requirements of the target material .
Different materials have different crystalline structures , and thus different molding methods and heat treatment methods should be used .
Such as target roughening treatment can make the target surface covered with rich bumps , under the effect , the potential of these bumps will be greatly increased , so as to breakdown the medium discharge , but too large bumps for the quality and stability of sputtering is not good .
The above is the main performance requirements of the target material , whether it is purity , density or size , you can see that the target material for a variety of performance requirements are very fine .
