Flat plate collector coating technology classification usually depends on the structure of the heat-absorbing plate form , there are currently four common : 1.
Coating technology usually has two ways : one is copper , aluminium strip coating after welding ; the advantage is that the process is good ; the disadvantage is that the ultrasonic welding seam at the destruction of the coating layer and electrochemical corrosion ( refers to the copper tube , aluminium strip welding seam ).
The advantage is not to destroy the coating layer , can be applied to a variety of materials strip coating , the disadvantage is that the coating cost is higher , generally using magnetron sputtering coating technology .
Wing tube type heat-absorbing plate is the use of die extrusion stretching process made of metal tube with wings on both sides of the heat-absorbing strip , and then welded with the upper and lower set of tubes into a heat-absorbing plate .
The advantage of the wing tube type heat absorbing plate is that the heat rate is high , the tube and the plate are bodies , no combined heat resistance ; strong pressure resistance , the aluminium alloy tube can withstand higher pressure .
Usually , the fluid channels are spot welded to each other and the heat absorbing plate is roll welded around .
Disadvantages : the welding process is difficult , easy to weld through or weld poorly ; poor pressure resistance , welded joints can not withstand higher pressure ; poor dynamics , the cross-section of the fluid channel is large , the heat-absorbing plate has a large heat capacity ; sometimes the water quality is not easy to ensure , aluminium alloy and galvanised steel can be corroded .
This type of structure is used more externally and is rarely used internally .
The advantages of the snake tube type heat absorbing plate are that there is no need to additionally weld the collector tube , reducing the possibility of leakage ; high heat rate , no combined heat resistance ; clean water , the copper tube will not be corroded ; ensure quality , the whole production process to achieve mechanisation ; strong pressure resistance , the copper tube can withstand higher pressure .
The general use of 1000 mm wide rolled plate coating technology , now within a few has been developed .
