Compared with another process of PVD-vacuum coating , the sputtering coating process has good repeatability and controllable film thickness , and a thin film with uniform thickness can be obtained on a large area substrate material .
Good , strong bonding with substrate materials , etc. , has become the main technology for preparing thin film materials .
