First use chemical methods to make indium tin oxide chemical composite powder , or mix monomer indium oxide powder and monomer tin oxide powder at a mass ratio of 9:1 to make mechanical composite powder.The powder is spherical or quasi-spherical , the average particle size is 30-200nm , the purity is 99%, and there is no hard agglomeration.
Put the composite powder into the envelope for cold isostatic pressing.The cold isostatic pressing medium is oil , the pressure is 200-280MPa , and the pressure holding time is 10min.The obtained rough density is 45%-55% of the theoretical density .
Load the rough billet into a container of corresponding size.The container and the rough body are separated by a metal tantalum film or a nickel film or a niobium film or a platinum film to prevent them from reacting under high temperature and pressure .
Put the above container into a hot isostatic pressing furnace for hot isostatic pressing.The hot isostatic pressing temperature is 100-300℃ , and the holding time is 0.5-6h , the pressure of argon atmosphere is 100-120MPa .
