And with the development of the times , more and more emerging materials appear in the target family also ushered in a new member – titanium aluminum alloy target .
So what is the production method of titanium aluminum alloy target ?
The method has low cost and high density , which can fully meet the requirements of large-scale industrial production .
Therefore , the key to the preparation method is to have a high-current device that meets the process requirements and has stable performance .
One is to use the casting method to make ingots first , and then carry out the forging process to make the target ; the other is to use the spray molding method to make the titanium aluminum alloy target .
In the process of making aluminum alloy sputtering target by casting and forging , the important step of adding alloying elements often makes the aluminum alloy target produce segregation phenomenon , which leads to the poor quality of sputtering film , and the surface of sputtering target is easy to produce micro-particles , affecting the uniformity of film properties .
In addition to the above several titanium aluminum alloy target production methods , today’s four Feng’s editor in a bit of popularization of the production process is simple and very low cost production method – to gas spray powder production of titanium aluminum alloy target .
The main principle of air-jet powder method is to make the raw material powder of target by air-jet method according to the proportion of alloy ; then the alloy powder will be sieved to get the proper powder particle size ; then the powder will be vacuum hot pressed to make it into a target .
The advantage of this production method is that it can be used to make various kinds of aluminum alloy targets such as aluminum , chromium ; aluminum , silicon , copper ; aluminum , titanium ; and so on .
in addition , the process has the problem of difficult demolding and low die life when preparing titanium-aluminum alloy targets with high aluminum content .
Therefore , it is necessary to choose the suitable release agent to improve the yield and the utilization rate of the mold .
