(3) Crush the foamed chromium aluminum alloy with a crusher to become ?200 mesh alloy powder , then the alloy powder is placed in a cold isostatic pressing jacket , vacuumed and sealed , and pressed at a pressure of 200 MPa to 400 MPa for 30 to 60 minutes to obtain a chromium aluminum alloy billet ;
After the treatment is completed , place the ladle in the hot isostatic pressing equipment for hot isostatic pressing sintering to obtain the chromium-aluminum alloy ingot .
