Magnetron sputtering coating is a new type of physical vapor phase coating method , which uses an electron gun system to emit and focus electrons on the material to be coated , so that the atoms sputtered out follow the principle of momentum conversion and fly away from the material with high kinetic energy to deposit a film on the substrate .
