11 ways to start a diesel generator that you fear the most?
Incorrect Start Mode 1: Increase the throttle start Please do not fuel the door when the generator is starting.Just put the throttle in the idle position.Some operators want a diesel generator to start quickly, filling the door hard before or during startup.The hazards are as follows:
② The speed of diesel generator may rise rapidly after the big throttle starts, which will cause greater damage to the moving parts (aggravating wear and tear or causing cylinder pulling faults).
In hot season, please use high viscosity oil and fuel;In cold weather, use low viscosity oil and fuel oil.Otherwise, the generator will be difficult to start or not start at all.Even a successful forced start could cause incalculable damage to a diesel generator.
When starting a diesel generator, do not place it at the intake pipe.Otherwise, the ash and hard debris generated by material combustion will be sucked into the cylinder, causing the inlet and exhaust door to be closed loosely and the cylinder to be pulled.
Heating method of oil in oil pan: use special heater (or steam).During the heating process, please slowly turn the oil shaft, so that the oil is heated evenly, so that all parts are lubricated.The wrong use of open fire baking oil pan, easy to cause local deformation of oil pan or oil deterioration in the oil pan.
The electric heating wire is the heating element of the electric plug or flame preheater.Its power consumption and heat are very large, long-term use will damage the battery due to rapid discharge, but also burn out the electric heating wire.Suggestions: the continuous use time of electric plug should not exceed 1min;The continuous service time of flame preheater should be controlled within 30s.
The starting motor on the diesel generator works under the condition of low voltage and high current, and long time use will damage the battery.Continuous working time shall not exceed 10s;A start is not good, should be 15s to start again.
When the diesel generator is forced to start the trailer under the condition of cold running and high oil viscosity, the wear between the moving parts of the diesel engine will be aggravated, thus reducing the service life of the diesel engine.
For the diesel generator set operating in high temperature environment, the ventilation state of the diesel generator room should be ensured to be in good condition. If possible, a refrigeration system can be configured.
Check whether the circulating cooling water in the water tank is sufficient before starting. If not, it should be replenished with pure water.
Ensure the cleanliness of the cooling system. Remove dirt in time.
