In plastic processing, it can reduce the friction between plastic particles, the friction between plastic macromolecules, the adhesion of plastic to the metal surface of processing equipment, and the additives that improve the fluidity of plastic melt and increase processing efficiency. Ø Antistatic agent
Additives that are mixed into plastics or coated on the surface of plastic products, which can reduce surface resistance and impart electrical conductivity appropriately, thereby eliminating or preventing the harmful effects of static charge accumulation. Most antistatic agents are ionic and non-ionic surfactants.
