What can and should not be done while downloading?
Occasionally, but still there are programs that, when downloading the movie, save to the disk various support files or fragments of downloaded files to be merged. If you use such a solution, remember not to delete these files until the operation is completed - this also applies to the situation when the final file is joined from two: audio and movie.
In the vast majority of cases, the download is completed automatically: the final file is saved, any partial files are deleted. The programs do not close by themselves, they only display a completion message.
Most of the programs that help with this are written really smart, and the clean interface helps you set all the options right away. Download sites are a bit worse, because these tools are less ergonomic, but in practice, they are also manageable, except for the bothersome pop-ups with ads.
