Unsurprisingly, Premium members enjoy preferential treatment, enjoy the benefits of the number one product display, 28 product displays (standard and basic members get 12 and 5 respectively), and they can even get their own personalized customer service.
If you are interested in expanding the market or taking advantage of international sales opportunities, Alibaba can provide your company with the opportunity to do so. If you want to give full play to the role of Alibaba sellers, be sure to take the time to set up your account in the right way and use the available tools and resources.
